# Phase 1 counts a single configuration's quorum as half its members, by
# count: a plain leader of four acceptors wins on its own promise and one
# more, fewer than a Phase-1 quorum. `close_phase1` restates the same
# predicate, so no core assert sees it. The plain Phase-1 oracle must
# catch it (#458 (core oracles)).
excuse: none
expect: caught
file: crates/lib/paros-core/src/proposer/election.rs
--- find
            .all(|config| config.has_phase1_quorum(&self.promises.answered))
--- replace
            .all(|config| {
                config.has_phase1_quorum(&self.promises.answered)
                    || (self.prior.len() == 1
                        && 2 * self.promises.answered.len() >= config.members().len())
            })
--- end
